d1ed590d3f10f16f297?s=96&d=mm&r=g","caption":"Jen Miller, PhD, MBA, MSML"},"description":"Jen Miller, PhD, MBA, MSML, is the Director of Business Development at WebDevStudios and strategizes meeting clients’ needs with exciting, integrated solutions. Jen's more than 25 years of media experience and background as an entrepreneur, team leader, product and content marketer, journalist, educator, core contributor to the WordPress, and community builder makes her a valuable executive team member. Jen has also been an organizer for WordCamps in Los Angeles, Orange County, and Riverside in California, and Phoenix in Arizona, and is a professional speaker and lecturer on tech, SEO, entrepreneurship, and content marketing worldwide. She serves as an adjunct faculty member at several universities and holds a Bachelor of Arts in Liberal Studies, a Master of Science in Management and Leadership (MSML), a Master of Business Administration (MBA), and a Doctorate of Philosophy (PhD) in Business, with an emphasis on Entrepreneurship.","sameAs":["https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/in\/jen-miller-phd\/","https:\/\/x.com\/JenMillerPhD"],"honorificPrefix":"Dr","honorificSuffix":"PhD","gender":"female","knowsAbout":["business","entrepreneurship","web development","marketing"],"knowsLanguage":["English"],"jobTitle":"Director Of Business Development","worksFor":"WebDevStudios","url":"https:\/\/webdevstudios.com\/author\/jen-millerwebdevstudios-com\/"}]}</script>
